WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.520
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain an American action comedy film called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:18.960
“Barely Lethal”. Watch out and take care!
Prescott Academy is a government-run secret&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:24.960
institution that trains little girls into becoming&nbsp;
assassins. The chief of the organization, Hardman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:30.800
brings them in as young as ten months old to teach&nbsp;
them everything about life, without guidance from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.080
outside media. Little girls of the Prescott&nbsp;
Academy are trained to be killing machines.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:41.200
They learn to shoot at three years old with guns&nbsp;
that are taller than them. When they turn five,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.800
they are taught to drive, and by a year, they&nbsp;
can skillfully indulge in a high-speed car chase.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.600
Every day, they practice different forms of&nbsp;
fighting skills, so when they turn into teenagers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:56.240
they can be used for several dangerous missions&nbsp;
without being suspected. The number one rule&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:02.320
that Hardman stands by is "no attachments".&nbsp;
Therefore, although the girls are all orphans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:06.480
they have never been allowed to form connections&nbsp;
with each other. They aren’t given any names&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.120
and are known as their agent numbers. 
Currently, the best student in the academy is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:16.320
number eighty-three. She shoots like a killer&nbsp;
that she is trained to be and fights the best&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:21.840
among everyone. But, the “no attachments” rule&nbsp;
never made sense to her. One day, the girls are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:27.440
given the task of poking a stuffed toy with a pen.&nbsp;
While the other girls do as told, Eighty-three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:32.800
holds the toy to her chest. Hardman presents&nbsp;
her as a bad example and tears the toy’s head.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:38.560
Eighty-three has emotions piling up inside her&nbsp;
that are about to burst one day. As time passes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:43.440
she grows into a teenager with outstanding&nbsp;
fighting skills. Her biggest competitor is number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.800
Eighty-four who has always been the second-best&nbsp;
at everything. She despises Eighty-three and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.360
could kill her if they weren’t working for the&nbsp;
same agency. Eight-three is the first one in her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:58.640
class to be activated, meaning that she is sent on&nbsp;
dangerous missions before all of her classmates.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:03.920
As usual, Eighty-four is not happy about&nbsp;
it but she has no authority to protest. 
&nbsp;

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:08.480
After being activated, Eighty-three goes on&nbsp;
several missions. Since she is a teenager,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:13.680
she is never suspected of being an agent. She&nbsp;
completes all of her tasks with ease impressing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:19.040
Hardman. However, she still longs for the&nbsp;
normal teenage life that she never got to live.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:24.080
In one of her missions, she is spying on a target&nbsp;
when she notices a party going on next door.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:28.880
Seeing the teenagers dance and have fun&nbsp;
makes Eighty-three realize that her life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:33.600
isn’t normal. She has missed a huge part of her&nbsp;
childhood and doesn’t want her teenage years to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.640
go in vain. Eighty-three decides to flee from&nbsp;
the establishment and its responsibility the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:44.320
next chance she gets. But before that, she has to&nbsp;
know what being a normal girl actually looks like.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:49.520
For this, she starts to gather intel on teenage&nbsp;
high school life by watching movies like Mean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:55.200
Girls, The princess diary, and Clueless. Every&nbsp;
time she is away on a mission, she buys magazines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.600
to secretly read them during boring meetings.&nbsp;
One day, her habit gets her in trouble when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:04.080
Hardman finds her reading a magazine as he is&nbsp;
briefing her about an important mission. 
&nbsp;

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:08.800
He orders her to come back to her senses&nbsp;
because the next mission is very dangerous.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:14.480
An arms dealer and the most dangerous woman&nbsp;
in the mafia, Victoria was located in a city&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:19.840
eight hours ago. She has to be captured alive&nbsp;
within two days or else she will disappear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.560
again. Eighty-four wants to go on the mission,&nbsp;
hoping that it would make her Hardman’s favorite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.360
but Eighty-three is given the task. In the&nbsp;
following scene, we see that Victoria is in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:34.560
a construction zone with three hostages. She&nbsp;
insults them and takes their blindfolds off.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:39.040
All of a sudden, the female hostage reveals&nbsp;
that she is Eighty-three. In an instant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:44.320
Eighty-three attacks Knox and overpowers all her&nbsp;
henchmen. She ties a hook to Knox that goes up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:49.200
to an airplane flying overhead. At last, they&nbsp;
are pulled up to the plane, and Eighty-three’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:53.840
mission is complete. But since Knox still has&nbsp;
her gun, she points it at her. Eighty-three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:58.720
cuts the harness and drops into the river below&nbsp;
while Knox is pulled inside the airplane. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:04.160
Hardman notices Eighty-three’s absence, he tries&nbsp;
to contact her on a device attached to her wrist.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:09.360
Eighty-three gets out of the water and hears him.&nbsp;
However, she doesn’t reply, knowing that this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:14.640
is her only chance to escape her old life. 
She throws her watch away and decides to never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:18.720
look back. Back in the airplane, Hardman is&nbsp;
told that they aren’t receiving any visuals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:24.960
or audio from her. He declares her “inactive” and&nbsp;
continues interrogating Victoria. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:29.920
Eighty-three creates an entirely new identity&nbsp;
under the name Megan. She also transfers into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:35.040
a high school in Newton and finds a family to stay&nbsp;
with through a website. At the airport, the family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:40.720
comes to pick her up. It consists of the mother,&nbsp;
Mrs. Larson, her son Parker and her sarcastic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:46.080
teenage daughter Liz. Liz is not too happy about&nbsp;
Megan’s arrival and has a hard time adjusting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:51.120
with her around the house. She finds it weird that&nbsp;
Megan is excited about normal things like riding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:56.160
the school bus. Still, to please her mother,&nbsp;
she agrees to help Megan around the school. 
&nbsp;

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:01.920
On her first day at school, Megan dresses up in a&nbsp;
ridiculous outfit, making everyone stare at her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:07.840
Only a few minutes in, a bully named Gooch calls&nbsp;
her “fresh meat” as everyone laughs. To make her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:12.560
feel better, Liz gives her less patterned clothes&nbsp;
to wear. During the morning assembly, she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:17.360
supposed to talk in front of everyone as a foreign&nbsp;
exchange student. Before going to the stage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:22.960
she meets a geeky kid named Roger who manages the&nbsp;
A/V for the school’s band. As per the movies she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:28.800
has watched, Megan declares him a nerd. She is&nbsp;
introduced to the entire school but they make fun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:33.920
of her, calling her names. Soon, they start asking&nbsp;
her to go back to Canada where she came from. 
&nbsp;

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:42.320
When the chanting gets louder, the school’s band&nbsp;
leader Cash interrupts the crowd with a song.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:47.680
He is the most popular guy in the school and is&nbsp;
liked by many. Megan is also instantly attracted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:52.160
to him. During the lunch break, some cheerleaders&nbsp;
call her to eat with them but she refuses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:56.880
assuming that they are mean like the cheerleaders&nbsp;
from her favorite movies. In biology class,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:02.000
she again meets Roger and makes friends with him.&nbsp;
He seems to be attracted to her but all Megan can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:07.920
focus on is Cash. The next day, she is assigned&nbsp;
as Cash’s lab partner. However, other girls from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:15.520
the class ask her to choose another partner,&nbsp;
wanting Cash for themselves. After the class,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:22.800
the girls tell Megan that Cash likes girls&nbsp;
who play the school’s mascot. Megan fails to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:27.680
realize that they are trying to set her up and&nbsp;
goes to audition to be the school’s mascot.
&nbsp;

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:32.640
She is selected instantly and called to practice&nbsp;
for the next game. During the practice, a group of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:38.720
masked men run towards her and try to kidnap her.&nbsp;
Megan uses her skills to easily overpower them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:42.720
surprising everyone around her. She had&nbsp;
thought that the masked people were agents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:47.440
sent by Hardman but it turns out they are guys&nbsp;
from a rival college trying to cause trouble.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:52.800
By the time she realizes this, everyone is filming&nbsp;
her. They upload the video on social media,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:58.800
much to her horror. In Prescott’s base, Victoria&nbsp;
is being held and interrogated by Hardman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:03.520
She is also aware that his way of stealing a&nbsp;
good childhood from young girls is wrong. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:08.560
calls him out for it but the man insists that&nbsp;
he is doing it for a good cause. Victoria also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:13.120
shows special interest in number Eighty-four&nbsp;
and is planning to use her to escape. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:18.240
soon find out about the viral video of Megan and&nbsp;
assume she is now working for a rival group. 
&nbsp;

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:23.120
The next day at school, everyone is talking about&nbsp;
Megan’s outstanding fighting skills. She turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:28.480
into one of the popular girls overnight. Her day&nbsp;
gets even better when Cash calls her to his band&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:33.280
practice after school. When she reaches there,&nbsp;
she meets Roger and talks to him while waiting for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:39.040
Cash. Roger loves her personality and registers&nbsp;
that they have a lot in common. But Megan is too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:44.240
busy drooling over Cash to see that he likes her.&nbsp;
Later, she is invited to a high school party that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:49.360
her bully Gooch is throwing at his house. Megan&nbsp;
is beyond excited because she has only heard of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:55.200
such parties in movies. While returning home that&nbsp;
day, she is kidnapped by people from Prescott.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:59.920
Hardman has assumed that she is working for a&nbsp;
rival establishment and refuses to believe it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:04.800
when she tells him that she just wants to have a&nbsp;
normal life. He injects her with a truth drug and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:09.360
finds out she is actually telling the truth.&nbsp;
Hardman feels entitled to her life since he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:14.320
taught her everything she knows. He orders her&nbsp;
to return to base in two days. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:18.880
his people dump her on the front porch of the&nbsp;
house to make Megan look like she's just drunk.
&nbsp;

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:23.680
When Megan meets Roger the next time, she invites&nbsp;
him to Gooch’s party. But since his father is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:28.400
strict about parties, he refuses to go. Megan&nbsp;
would feel better if he was there since he is her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:33.520
only friend in the school. Later that night, Megan&nbsp;
comes to the party with Liz, who was forced by her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:38.720
mother to accompany her. To Megan's surprise,&nbsp;
Eighty-four is also at the party, now going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:43.520
by the name Heather. Megan thinks Hardman sent&nbsp;
Heather to keep an eye on her but Heather doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:49.360
confirm or deny the claim. Roger also comes to the&nbsp;
party looking for Megan but is disappointed to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:53.920
her kissing Cash. By the end of the night,&nbsp;
Cash asks her to be his homecoming date. 
&nbsp;

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:58.800
The next morning, Megan gets on the school bus to&nbsp;
see that Hardman is disguised as the driver. He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:03.680
there to warn her that Victoria has escaped from&nbsp;
Prescott and is planning to take revenge on her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:09.120
He offers her to return to Prescott but Megan&nbsp;
refuses. Later, we see her and Liz driving to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:14.400
school when they are pursued by a masked assassin.&nbsp;
While in a car chase, Megan tells Liz the truth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:19.440
about her past life. They eventually crash&nbsp;
in a junkyard along with the assassin’s car.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:24.400
The assassin is lost but Megan recognizes her&nbsp;
to be Heather by the scent of her perfume.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:28.560
Liz is in the hospital after the crash.&nbsp;
Megan wants to leave before more people get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:33.280
hurt because of her but Liz thinks that Megan&nbsp;
trying to abandon the family would be worse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:38.320
Starting that day, they get along well. Megan&nbsp;
tells Liz everything about her life as an agent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:42.960
They shop outfits for homecoming together and&nbsp;
get each other ready for the special night. 
&nbsp;

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:52.000
Liz goes out with Gooch, who has changed after&nbsp;
spending time with her at the party. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:56.800
Chase and Megan go together. Megan had thought&nbsp;
that the night would be special but Chase hardly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.800 --> 00:10:02.000
talks to her. After spending some time with him,&nbsp;
she realizes that his entire personality is being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:08.480
popular. She dumps him and goes to Roger, asking&nbsp;
him for a dance. To her surprise, he declines and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:13.040
turns to his date for the night, Heather. The&nbsp;
girls argue about who gets to be his date and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:18.400
eventually get into a fight. They wrestle around&nbsp;
the venue, destroying the decorations. Eventually,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:23.680
they end up in the kitchen where Heather is about&nbsp;
to stab Megan. Liz sneaks up on Heather and stabs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:29.360
her in the leg with a corn dog stick. Then, Megan&nbsp;
hits Heather over the head and knocks her out.
&nbsp;

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:34.240
Following that, the girls run back home to&nbsp;
see that Victoria and her people have taken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:40.480
Mrs. Larson and Parker hostage. Megan fights&nbsp;
them efficiently until they capture Liz. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:45.520
stops resisting for the family’s safety but still&nbsp;
has hope that Hardman will come to save her. 
&nbsp;

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:52.000
Victoria laughs at her for being so naive and&nbsp;
reveals that she was the very first Prescott girl,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:58.000
number one. Like Megan, she also left Prescott for&nbsp;
robbing her of her childhood. She challenges Megan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:03.600
to a one-on-one fight and defeats her easily.&nbsp;
Suddenly, Hardman arrives with reinforcements&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:09.360
to help Megan and capture Victoria. They break in&nbsp;
and knock out Victoria with a tranquilizer gun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:15.360
Megan hugs Hardman, thanking him for the help. In&nbsp;
the last scene, she stops Roger on his drive home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:20.000
and brings him with her to a helicopter ride. 
